          <li><a href="/math/right-triangle-area-calculator/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Right Triangle Area Calculator</a> – Compute triangle areas and Pythagorean hypotenuse dimensions.</li>
          <li><a href="/math/scientific-calculator/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Scientific Calculator</a> – High-precision mathematical and trigonometric functions.</li>
          <li><a href="/construction/concrete-material-breakup-calculator/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Concrete Mix Calculator</a> – Estimate cement, sand, and aggregate volume for construction slabs and columns.</li>
          <li><a href="/general/unit-converter/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Unit Converter</a> – Convert between metric, imperial, and astronomical units.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
